{"page_id": "realdoc_pages-images_e6fd8dbe_images_d4be80d8-4ba6-4f5f-bd6a-22d80f85aa62-p1", "markdown": "# South Eastern Railway\n\nOffice of the Pr. Chief Operations Manager, 11, Garden Reach Road, Kolkata - 700 043.\n\nT.96/51/ Summer Special Trains/24\n\nDate: 25.03.2025\n\nSub: -\n\nRunning of 02863/02864 SRC-YPR-SRC Special trains (TOD).\n\nRef: - (l) PED(Chg.)/NDRB's M. No. CMC/25/68, Dated: 25.03.2025\n\n(il) CPTM/SWR's L.No. T.405/II/Specials/SCR/2024-25(610), Dated: 24.03.2025\n\n(ill) This office Letter No: T 96/41/Special Train/TOD/2025 Dated:13.03.2025\n\nVide reference to above, it has been decided to run 02863/02864 SRC-YPR-SRC Special Train On Demand\n\nar extra rush of passengers as under:\n\nEx. SRC on every Thursday from 03.04.2025 to 24.04.2025\n\nEx. YPR on every Saturday from 05.04.2025 to 26.04.2025\n\nComposition: LWACCN-18, LWLRRM-2, = 20 LHB\n\n04 Trips.\n\n04 Trips.\n\nBPC: RBPC at SRC OEM at YPR/SWR\n\nCrew and Guard: To be co-ordinate by Div/Zone\n\nTraction: Electric over SER\n\nWatering & CTS: KUR, VZM, & BZA\n\nTimings & Stoppages :\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">02863 SRC-YPR SpI TOD</td><td colspan=\"3\">02864 YPR-SRC SPL TOD</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Arr</td><td>Dep</td><td>Stn</td><td>Arr</td><td>Dep</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>12:50</td><td>SRC</td><td>13:25</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>14:23</td><td>14:28</td><td>KGP</td><td>11:00</td><td>11:05</td></tr>\n<tr><td>15:58</td><td>16:00</td><td>BLS</td><td>9:20</td><td>9:22</td></tr>\n<tr><td>16:58</td><td>17:00</td><td>BHC</td><td>8:40</td><td>8:42</td></tr>\n<tr><td>18:25</td><td>18:30</td><td>CTC</td><td>6:35</td><td>6:40</td></tr>\n<tr><td>18:52</td><td>18:57</td><td>BBS</td><td>5:50</td><td>5:55</td></tr>\n<tr><td>19:20</td><td>19:30</td><td>KUR</td><td>5:15</td><td>5:25</td></tr>\n<tr><td>21:20</td><td>21:22</td><td>BAM</td><td>3:18</td><td>3:20</td></tr>\n<tr><td>22:53</td><td>22:55</td><td>PSA</td><td>2:30</td><td>2:32</td></tr>\n<tr><td>23:47</td><td>23:49</td><td>CHE</td><td>1:1